  "task": {
    "objective": "Fulfill four physical soup orders while coordinating reusable bowls, cooking/cleaning utensils and finite-capacity clean/waste water infrastructure.",
    "natural_termination": "Natural end when each of the four customers has either been served or left after its own patience expired. H=256 is the upper truncation window; natural causes take priority.",
    "interaction": "An upstream wash consumes shared clean water and creates sink dirt. Opening its drain moves dirty parcels toward the coworker's pan unless a physical filter or diversion catches them. Tool exchange transfers preparation and cleaning capabilities between the two workers.",
    "observation_access": "Fully observable compact kitchen. Both roles receive identical flat native maps, actors/items/tools and holders, clean/prepared/filled/age/spoiled flags, every drainage-cell parcel, tank/sink/basin/filter/pan state, customer patience/outcomes and reward components. Inactive ingredients and completed orders remain fixed slots in observations but disappear from active scene groups."
